WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
The safe opens.

00:05.000 --> 00:12.000
Fischer sees what his father left behind.

00:12.000 --> 00:20.000
The meaning is in the message, not the safe.

00:20.000 --> 00:27.000
Fischer understands what his father wanted him to know.

00:27.000 --> 00:29.150
The dream releases its hold.
